WEBVTT

00:10.010 --> 00:12.012
[suspenseful action music]

00:19.060 --> 00:21.354
[Jae-jun's mom] Jae-jun,
are you still at the base?

00:21.438 --> 00:24.024
-You're not going anywhere, right?
-[captain] Put on your gas masks!

00:24.107 --> 00:26.776
I won't go there, Mom. Don't worry, okay?

00:26.860 --> 00:29.821
[Jae-jun's mom] They said on TV that all
the soldiers were being sent there.

00:29.904 --> 00:31.030
That must include you too.

00:31.114 --> 00:33.241
[sighs]
Why would it? I'm almost discharged.

00:33.324 --> 00:35.243
When you're about to be discharged,

00:35.326 --> 00:37.245
they don't have you stand guard
or even train.

00:37.328 --> 00:38.580
[Jae-jun's mom] Yeah, right.

00:38.663 --> 00:40.915
Then why did they cancel your last leave?

00:41.624 --> 00:43.501
Do you have any idea how worried I am?

00:43.585 --> 00:45.378
-You didn't even call--
-Mom.

00:45.462 --> 00:46.713
[Jae-jun's mom] Yes? What?

00:46.796 --> 00:47.797
I gotta go.

00:47.881 --> 00:50.842
[Jae-jun's mom] Did you go somewhere else
instead of coming home?

00:51.718 --> 00:52.594
Where are you going?

00:53.178 --> 00:54.471
To play soccer. Bye, Mom.

00:54.554 --> 00:56.389
-[Jae-jun's mom] Jae-jun!
-[cocks gun]

00:59.809 --> 01:00.852
[hisses]

01:03.396 --> 01:04.481
[gunfire]

01:05.648 --> 01:06.858
[zombies growling in distance]

01:09.569 --> 01:13.281
[Jae-jun's mom] What are you doing
playing soccer? What if you get hurt?

01:13.364 --> 01:14.741
[growls]

01:16.201 --> 01:17.869
[gunfire]

01:17.952 --> 01:20.497
I mean, what do you want me
to do all day? Hmm?

01:20.580 --> 01:22.290
I'm tired of playing video games.

01:22.373 --> 01:24.584
[Jae-jun's mom] All you did before
was play video games.

01:25.085 --> 01:26.252
[gunfire]

01:26.336 --> 01:27.253
[growling]

01:30.340 --> 01:31.800
-[captain] Status.
-[soldier 1] Clear.

01:31.883 --> 01:33.092
[soldier 2] Clear.

01:33.176 --> 01:34.385
[captain] Report.

01:34.928 --> 01:37.138
[soldier 1] Control, this is Shadow Gamma.

01:37.222 --> 01:39.641
We cleared all the infected
on the ground floor.

01:39.724 --> 01:41.017
No survivors founded.

01:42.227 --> 01:43.686
We're moving to the third floor.

01:48.566 --> 01:51.694
[Jae-jun's mom] I can tell you're lying.
You're not playing soccer, are you?

01:51.778 --> 01:53.321
Promise, I am.

01:53.404 --> 01:56.074
-[gunfire]
-[growls, shrieks]

02:07.377 --> 02:09.295
[man 1 breathing shakily]

02:10.505 --> 02:11.923
[Jae-jun] Come out. You're safe.

02:12.757 --> 02:14.425
-We're saved! Come out.
-[people clamoring]

02:14.509 --> 02:15.552
-[man 2] Hurry.
-[woman] Thank you.

02:15.635 --> 02:17.137
-[Jae-jun] Slowly. Walk. Slowly.
-[woman] Thank you.

02:17.220 --> 02:19.347
[Jae-jun] Walk in a single file.
It's safe out there.

02:24.811 --> 02:25.687
[gunfire]

02:28.982 --> 02:30.483
[soldier 1] Zone three secured.

02:30.567 --> 02:31.609
Two infected sighted.

02:33.153 --> 02:34.737
[captain] Copy. Take them down.

02:38.074 --> 02:39.826
[zombie growling in distance]

02:45.999 --> 02:47.250
[cocks gun]

02:47.333 --> 02:48.501
[breathes heavily]

02:48.585 --> 02:49.836
[electric buzzes]

02:53.381 --> 02:55.258
-[zombie growls]
-[gunfire]

02:55.341 --> 02:57.218
-[zombie growling]
-[gunfire]

03:06.603 --> 03:07.687
[Jae-jun gasps]

03:08.271 --> 03:10.815
[Jae-jun's mom] Just please don't go
anywhere that's too dangerous.

03:10.899 --> 03:12.942
-Okay? For me?
-[breathes shakily]

03:13.026 --> 03:14.402
I love you, son.

03:14.903 --> 03:15.737
[breathes shakily]

03:15.820 --> 03:17.447
You know that, right?

03:17.530 --> 03:18.698
I love you too, Mom.

03:19.949 --> 03:22.619
I'll see you later, okay?
When I'm discharged.

03:22.702 --> 03:23.953
[Jae-jun's mom] Jae-jun.

03:25.038 --> 03:26.372
Get back safely.

03:27.040 --> 03:28.791
Make sure to call me later.

03:28.875 --> 03:30.585
I'll be waiting, okay?

03:34.964 --> 03:36.674
[groaning]

03:45.475 --> 03:47.769
[straining]

03:48.937 --> 03:49.896
[growls]

04:01.282 --> 04:02.700
[Jae-jun growling]

04:06.204 --> 04:07.163
[door shuts]

04:08.289 --> 04:10.291
[theme music]

04:11.960 --> 04:14.545
[squelching]

04:25.807 --> 04:28.226
[all growling]

04:28.851 --> 04:29.936
[Byeong-chan] There's hope.

04:30.019 --> 04:32.981
A small number of white blood cells
were detected in the blood.

04:33.856 --> 04:36.526
Even after full transformation,
the white blood cells remained,

04:36.609 --> 04:38.945
and they were fighting like warriors.

04:39.028 --> 04:42.073
If I raise the body temperature,
I can activate these cells.

04:43.324 --> 04:44.534
Twenty-nine degrees now.

04:46.160 --> 04:47.870
In case blood isn't flowing,

04:47.954 --> 04:51.291
I'll raise the temperature
both internally and externally.

04:52.166 --> 04:53.376
[zombies growling]

04:56.754 --> 04:58.756
[suspenseful music]

05:01.342 --> 05:02.302
[gasping]

05:02.385 --> 05:03.886
[panting]

05:05.972 --> 05:06.889
[groans]

05:10.518 --> 05:11.602
[grunts]

05:17.734 --> 05:19.485
[breathes heavily]

05:32.832 --> 05:34.959
You guys can leave a message
as well if you want to.

05:38.296 --> 05:40.173
I don't really have anything to say.

05:43.342 --> 05:44.218
You?

05:52.977 --> 05:54.187
We trust you.

05:56.022 --> 05:57.315
You can untie it now.

06:01.569 --> 06:03.488
[retreating footsteps]

06:21.672 --> 06:22.882
[camera clicks]

06:24.967 --> 06:26.969
[mellow music]

06:31.891 --> 06:34.393
[camera whirs, clacks]

06:43.152 --> 06:45.488
Su-hyeok, I don't know
why you're doing this.

06:46.197 --> 06:48.074
Because the others are really scared.

06:52.245 --> 06:53.412
And you're not scared?

06:54.664 --> 06:55.790
Mm-mm.

06:57.375 --> 06:58.793
Why?

06:58.876 --> 06:59.794
Because…

07:00.336 --> 07:01.504
I'm just not.

07:07.593 --> 07:09.554
You know how I said
I wanted to bite you earlier?

07:09.637 --> 07:10.888
It's okay.

07:11.681 --> 07:12.640
It's in the past now.

07:17.895 --> 07:19.605
It felt like I was dreaming.

07:22.066 --> 07:24.402
You were just giving off
such a beautiful scent.

07:25.361 --> 07:26.654
What kind of scent?

07:30.533 --> 07:31.534
I'm not sure.

07:32.326 --> 07:35.037
It was something
that I had never smelled before.

07:37.957 --> 07:40.251
All I could think about was eating you.

07:42.795 --> 07:44.881
How much I wanted to bite you.

07:45.756 --> 07:48.259
Bite you and eat you.

07:51.846 --> 07:53.222
I only thought…

07:57.810 --> 08:00.771
Then I heard your voice suddenly saying…

08:03.733 --> 08:04.817
[Su-hyeok] Nam-ra.

08:06.360 --> 08:08.362
[mellow music]

08:08.946 --> 08:11.199
It was your voice that woke me up.

08:13.951 --> 08:16.037
You know you never called me by my name.

08:16.662 --> 08:18.706
It was always "Hey," or "Prez."

08:24.545 --> 08:26.506
It was the first time you said my name.

08:30.968 --> 08:31.802
[gulps]

08:36.390 --> 08:37.391
I know.

08:40.269 --> 08:41.771
I was afraid you'd know…

08:43.064 --> 08:44.398
if I said your name.

08:45.566 --> 08:46.776
What?

08:49.695 --> 08:50.988
That I like you.

08:53.950 --> 08:54.867
[sighs]

08:57.161 --> 08:58.663
I don't get good grades,

08:59.497 --> 09:02.291
and I used to hang out
with bullies before.

09:03.292 --> 09:05.711
But you, you're a perfect student.

09:06.212 --> 09:07.797
You get good grades.

09:10.341 --> 09:11.425
[sighs]

09:12.134 --> 09:13.427
And you're so pretty.

09:18.558 --> 09:19.559
[camera clacks]

09:32.071 --> 09:32.947
Su-hyeok.

09:34.782 --> 09:35.908
I like you.

09:41.831 --> 09:42.790
[camera clacks]

09:52.133 --> 09:54.510
[mellow music]

10:08.691 --> 10:09.817
I'm glad…

10:12.612 --> 10:14.196
to know before I die.

10:31.130 --> 10:33.132
[mellow music continues]

10:57.114 --> 10:59.492
[clock ticks]

11:00.534 --> 11:02.912
[foreboding music]

11:04.413 --> 11:06.707
[kettle hissing]

11:06.791 --> 11:07.792
[clock ticking]

11:09.251 --> 11:10.795
-[kettle hissing]
-[water trickles]

11:10.878 --> 11:12.672
-[clocks tickling]
-[kettle hissing]

11:13.464 --> 11:14.715
[water trickles]

11:14.799 --> 11:15.966
[fins rustling]

11:18.761 --> 11:20.638
NIGHT DUTY ROOM

11:22.765 --> 11:25.393
[foreboding music continues]

11:29.814 --> 11:33.109
[door knob creaking]

11:34.944 --> 11:35.986
[door knob clanks]

11:38.489 --> 11:39.907
[water trickling]

11:41.617 --> 11:42.618
[door creaks]

11:48.624 --> 11:49.834
[water trickling]

11:56.048 --> 11:58.050
[foreboding music]

12:04.390 --> 12:05.683
[screams]

12:06.392 --> 12:07.518
Hello, sir.

12:08.727 --> 12:10.062
[sighs in relief]

12:10.146 --> 12:11.397
Shit. You scared me.

12:11.897 --> 12:12.815
[exhales sharply]

12:13.524 --> 12:14.442
[Yong-nam] You're…

12:14.525 --> 12:17.236
You're Seon-yeong, right?

12:18.737 --> 12:19.572
Eun-ji.

12:20.156 --> 12:21.991
Right. Eun-ji, right.

12:22.700 --> 12:23.701
[sighs]

12:26.704 --> 12:28.372
Are you all right?

12:28.456 --> 12:29.748
[Eun-ji] I am.

12:31.792 --> 12:33.586
Except that I'm starving.

12:35.004 --> 12:36.380
It's driving me crazy.

12:36.964 --> 12:38.424
-What?
-[gasps]

12:40.009 --> 12:40.926
Hey.

12:41.010 --> 12:42.178
-[water trickling]
-Hey.

12:42.887 --> 12:44.138
[breathes heavily]

12:45.806 --> 12:47.808
[ominous music]

12:47.892 --> 12:49.310
[munching]

12:51.103 --> 12:52.605
[crunching]

12:55.691 --> 12:57.526
[Eun-ji munching]

12:58.152 --> 13:00.863
Are… are you all right?

13:02.281 --> 13:03.491
[Yong-nam] You were bitten?

13:04.617 --> 13:05.618
Yeah.

13:06.243 --> 13:07.203
[munching]
I was.

13:14.710 --> 13:16.462
[breathes nervously]

13:18.172 --> 13:19.131
Okay.

13:19.840 --> 13:22.510
Wow, you must have been so hungry.

13:23.552 --> 13:24.512
Eun-ji.

13:25.346 --> 13:28.265
Jeez. That must have hurt a lot.

13:29.099 --> 13:29.934
Huh?

13:31.560 --> 13:33.312
Guess you should go to the infirmary!

13:33.395 --> 13:34.522
-[grunts]
-[shrieks]

13:38.651 --> 13:40.236
[Yong-nam breathes shakily]

13:44.406 --> 13:48.452
Remember what you said
when I said I was an outcast?

13:49.036 --> 13:50.538
[munches]

13:52.498 --> 13:53.832
"Don't tell me about it.

13:55.000 --> 13:56.335
Go tell your homeroom teacher."

14:00.506 --> 14:02.925
'Cause you didn't want them
to have a committee.

14:04.385 --> 14:06.971
[Eun-ji] "You're an outcast
because you're so dense."

14:09.265 --> 14:10.724
Do I still seem dense?

14:11.725 --> 14:14.728
[Yong-nam] Okay, I get it. So get out.

14:14.812 --> 14:15.980
[Yong-nam breathes shakily]

14:16.730 --> 14:19.275
Get out. Please, get out.

14:20.693 --> 14:22.695
[ominous music]

14:24.780 --> 14:25.739
Stay there.

14:26.323 --> 14:27.283
Stay back.

14:27.950 --> 14:29.660
[Yong-nam breathing heavily]

14:33.163 --> 14:33.998
Get out.

14:35.124 --> 14:36.208
Get out.

14:37.376 --> 14:39.253
-[growls]
-[grunting]

14:40.421 --> 14:41.422
[groaning]

14:42.089 --> 14:43.632
[grunting]

14:45.050 --> 14:47.303
[screaming]

14:52.933 --> 14:54.351
[munching]

14:59.023 --> 15:00.190
[growling in distance]

15:08.866 --> 15:09.992
What?

15:10.075 --> 15:11.744
I heard something strange.

15:32.056 --> 15:34.266
-What if she's finally starting to turn?
-Huh?

15:34.350 --> 15:35.476
What if half-bies don't turn?

15:35.559 --> 15:36.936
[gasps]
Oh, my gosh.

15:37.019 --> 15:38.270
My bad.

15:38.354 --> 15:40.272
-[Hyo-ryeong sighs]
-[Dae-su clears throat]

15:40.356 --> 15:41.357
[muffled groaning]

15:41.440 --> 15:42.483
I hear it.

15:42.566 --> 15:44.151
[muffled groaning, shrieking]

15:44.234 --> 15:45.861
-What?
-What do you hear?

15:45.945 --> 15:48.489
[muffled retching and coughing]

15:48.989 --> 15:50.908
I think someone is puking.

15:51.742 --> 15:55.454
-[groaning]
-[Eun-ji gagging]

16:00.250 --> 16:01.085
It stopped.

16:02.836 --> 16:05.089
[discord music playing]

16:05.673 --> 16:06.799
What stopped?

16:08.342 --> 16:09.802
The sound of puking.

16:09.885 --> 16:10.970
[growling]

16:13.013 --> 16:14.765
[Eun-ji breathes heavily]

16:17.726 --> 16:19.436
[Yong-nam grumbles]

16:20.771 --> 16:21.605
[Yong-nam snorts]

16:22.106 --> 16:25.067
[Eun-ji breathes heavily]

16:27.653 --> 16:29.196
Stop it. You're scaring me.

16:31.699 --> 16:32.825
Don't you hear it?

16:32.908 --> 16:34.952
I'm not hearing anything.

16:35.744 --> 16:37.997
[Hyo-ryeong breathes heavily]

16:39.915 --> 16:41.000
[heart beating rapidly]

16:41.083 --> 16:42.042
What?

16:42.626 --> 16:43.794
-What?
-[heart beating rapidly]

16:43.877 --> 16:45.129
Are you scared?

16:45.212 --> 16:46.171
Stop that.

16:46.672 --> 16:48.799
-It's just…
-[Hyo-ryeong breathes heavily]

16:48.882 --> 16:50.801
…you're the one breathing the loudest.

16:53.971 --> 16:55.472
[Yong-nam growls]

17:00.436 --> 17:01.353
[sighs]

17:03.731 --> 17:05.858
I hate this fucking school.

17:09.695 --> 17:10.779
Do you hear that?

17:12.031 --> 17:13.615
All I hear is that zombie.

17:13.699 --> 17:15.451
-[zombie growling]
-[piano creaking]

17:21.623 --> 17:23.625
[breathes deeply, gulps]

17:25.878 --> 17:27.254
[ticking]

17:28.964 --> 17:30.632
-[clacks]
-[Joon-yeong sighs]

17:39.016 --> 17:40.934
[Wu-jin farts]

17:41.018 --> 17:42.186
[grunts, sighs]

17:48.484 --> 17:49.693
What?

17:51.737 --> 17:53.697
[stomach grumbles]

17:58.744 --> 17:59.787
[object scraping]

18:00.621 --> 18:01.789
[footsteps]

18:04.875 --> 18:07.503
We should go. It's weird here.

18:08.170 --> 18:09.379
We can't just leave.

18:10.339 --> 18:11.840
There are zombies out there.

18:11.924 --> 18:12.841
[sighs]

18:12.925 --> 18:15.219
We should've gone to the roof
when the music was playing.

18:15.302 --> 18:16.720
Shit.

18:16.804 --> 18:17.721
Music.

18:18.430 --> 18:20.557
Wait a minute. We have music.

18:21.767 --> 18:23.185
What? What music?

18:26.855 --> 18:28.857
[foreboding music]

18:35.697 --> 18:36.949
[muffled grunting]

18:37.699 --> 18:39.034
[Myeong-hwan] Shit.

18:40.285 --> 18:41.745
[zombie muffled growling]

18:42.496 --> 18:43.831
-[growling]
-[water running]

18:47.751 --> 18:49.628
[Myeong-hwan breathes heavily, sniffles]

18:52.005 --> 18:53.841
This is insane.

18:53.924 --> 18:55.717
[breathes shakily]

19:02.099 --> 19:03.392
[gasps]
Oh, what the fuck!

19:03.475 --> 19:04.810
[gasping]

19:05.352 --> 19:07.062
What are you doing
you stupid piece of shit?

19:07.855 --> 19:08.939
You scared me.

19:10.274 --> 19:13.152
Hey, get down. Get down.

19:13.235 --> 19:14.945
Come on, come on. Move your ass.

19:15.487 --> 19:17.531
Get in here. Hurry up.

19:18.699 --> 19:19.908
Get in here.

19:19.992 --> 19:21.410
Get in, you asshole.

19:28.041 --> 19:30.335
-So, you okay?
-Huh?

19:31.420 --> 19:32.588
Where the fuck have you been?

19:32.671 --> 19:33.672
Me?

19:34.756 --> 19:36.216
Well, obviously, you.

19:37.176 --> 19:38.510
What happened to your eye?

19:39.094 --> 19:40.012
[groans]

19:40.095 --> 19:42.014
What? My eye?

19:43.640 --> 19:46.101
Get it together, idiot.

19:46.894 --> 19:48.645
What are you looking at, moron?

19:49.730 --> 19:50.647
Listen.

19:50.731 --> 19:52.191
Look. You see that car?

19:53.609 --> 19:55.569
-You're gonna go run in that way.
-Why should I?

19:55.652 --> 19:57.946
Shut up. You run if I say,
you little shit.

19:58.739 --> 19:59.990
You want me to lure the zombies?

20:01.074 --> 20:04.369
Mm-hmm. You go that way and lure them.

20:04.912 --> 20:06.914
I'll go over that way and scream.

20:06.997 --> 20:09.499
Then we run to the snack shop
while they're confused.

20:10.125 --> 20:11.210
Got it?

20:11.293 --> 20:12.920
I'll be going away from the snack shop.

20:13.003 --> 20:16.173
That's why you should run like hell
and circle around.

20:16.256 --> 20:17.966
Okay, come on. Run.

20:18.550 --> 20:19.635
No way.

20:19.718 --> 20:21.553
You chicken shit.

20:21.637 --> 20:23.180
All right, go. Go, come on--

20:23.263 --> 20:26.308
Don't talk to me that way.
I'm not your gopher now either.

20:27.184 --> 20:29.519
Hey. Are you fucking out of your mind?

20:30.520 --> 20:32.272
Snap out of it, will you?

20:33.065 --> 20:34.399
Look at me.

20:34.483 --> 20:35.817
It's me.

20:36.902 --> 20:37.819
Do it.

20:42.199 --> 20:44.284
Fine. I'll go.

20:44.368 --> 20:45.535
Go now.

20:47.788 --> 20:48.997
Hurry the fuck up.

20:52.292 --> 20:53.210
Come with me.

20:53.293 --> 20:54.169
[Myeong-hwan] What?

20:54.253 --> 20:55.754
[grunting]

20:57.089 --> 20:58.048
[groaning]

20:58.548 --> 20:59.883
[screaming]

21:00.425 --> 21:01.593
-[shushes]
-[grunting]

21:02.386 --> 21:03.553
Quiet.

21:04.554 --> 21:05.514
They'll hear you.

21:06.056 --> 21:07.140
[muffled groaning]

21:08.642 --> 21:09.768
Watch this.

21:09.851 --> 21:11.103
Look at it.

21:12.062 --> 21:14.648
You're nothing to me now, got it?

21:14.731 --> 21:16.149
[muffled groaning]

21:16.233 --> 21:18.527
Ah, you stupid chicken shit.

21:19.194 --> 21:20.529
Beg for your life.

21:20.612 --> 21:22.489
-[grunts]
-[Myeong-hwan whimpers]

21:23.824 --> 21:24.783
[Gwi-nam] Come on.

21:25.784 --> 21:27.869
"Save me." Come on.

21:28.662 --> 21:31.415
[stammering]
Save me. Please, please save me. Please.

21:31.498 --> 21:32.666
No way.

21:32.749 --> 21:34.793
-[screaming]
-[bone cracks]

21:35.711 --> 21:37.838
-[screaming]
-[zombies growling]

21:39.214 --> 21:42.509
Gwi-nam! Save me, you fucking asshole!

21:42.592 --> 21:44.928
[screaming]

21:48.557 --> 21:50.559
[Myeong-hwan wailing, screaming]

21:53.353 --> 21:54.396
Cheong-san.

21:56.315 --> 21:58.066
I'll gouge your eye out.

21:58.150 --> 22:00.110
-[zombies growling]
-[Myeong-hwan screaming]

22:05.699 --> 22:08.285
We're going to have to build
a tall barricade here,

22:08.368 --> 22:10.203
and then we lure them in with music.

22:10.287 --> 22:11.413
Use the instruments too.

22:12.164 --> 22:14.958
If we leave the door open,
they'll follow the music in.

22:15.042 --> 22:17.336
Once it's clear,
we take the back door up to the roof.

22:17.419 --> 22:19.129
In other words, what you're saying is

22:19.755 --> 22:23.175
we stack desks, chairs, and whatever else
we could find in the middle here.

22:24.051 --> 22:27.387
Open the front door
and run out through the back door, right?

22:28.680 --> 22:30.640
Not here. Farther back.

22:30.724 --> 22:32.017
We need more room on this side.

22:33.101 --> 22:34.227
And why is that?

22:34.311 --> 22:36.772
There aren't that many of us,
but there are lots of zombies.

22:37.397 --> 22:38.356
Ah…

22:38.940 --> 22:40.776
She sucks at school,
but she's pretty smart.

22:40.859 --> 22:41.943
Hey.

22:42.027 --> 22:43.403
It's a compliment.

22:46.323 --> 22:47.824
[Cheong-san] Let's give it a shot.

22:47.908 --> 22:49.659
We can figure out the rest later.

22:50.744 --> 22:51.745
We have a TV too.

22:52.329 --> 22:54.247
We should be able to connect it
and make it louder.

22:54.331 --> 22:56.249
I will have to look for the cord though.

22:57.042 --> 22:59.252
-Hey, can you help me look, Ji-min?
-[Ji-min] Sure.

22:59.753 --> 23:01.630
-Me too.
-[Joon-yeong] It should be over here.

23:01.713 --> 23:03.048
[Dae-su] Let's give it a shot.

23:05.008 --> 23:06.009
Guys.

23:07.552 --> 23:08.970
[On-jo] We should untie that.

23:09.054 --> 23:10.889
[Cheong-san] We should build
a frame first.

23:10.972 --> 23:13.225
I'll do the moving.
You guys work on the frame.

23:14.309 --> 23:15.310
It's okay.

23:15.936 --> 23:17.104
Su-hyeok.

23:17.187 --> 23:18.814
-[object clatters]
-[Wu-jin] Keep it down.

23:18.897 --> 23:21.399
She'll never be able to get close
to the others this way.

23:22.025 --> 23:23.485
And no one will approach her.

23:23.568 --> 23:24.402
[chairs scrape]

23:24.486 --> 23:25.987
[indistinct chattering]

23:26.696 --> 23:28.532
[On-jo] Hatred is contagious.

23:30.325 --> 23:31.660
But so is trust.

23:31.743 --> 23:33.120
[objects clattering]

23:33.203 --> 23:35.122
[indistinct chatter]

23:37.749 --> 23:38.750
Nam-ra.

23:40.710 --> 23:41.670
[metal clanking]

23:51.388 --> 23:53.557
You should've been the class president.

24:00.564 --> 24:02.691
[objects clattering]

24:10.323 --> 24:11.700
[Su-hyeok] Come on, let's help out.

24:12.409 --> 24:13.368
Let's go.

24:20.000 --> 24:21.334
[Dae-su] One, two, three.

24:28.925 --> 24:31.052
POLICE

24:33.138 --> 24:34.306
[groans]

24:35.098 --> 24:36.308
[grunting]

24:48.278 --> 24:49.237
[door creaking]

24:50.238 --> 24:53.325
RESTRICTED AREA

24:56.536 --> 24:57.704
-[grunting]
-[door creaking]

24:58.997 --> 25:00.165
[growling]

25:06.129 --> 25:08.089
-[grunting, gasps]
-[door creaking]

25:20.018 --> 25:21.186
[grunts]

25:21.853 --> 25:23.688
[growling]

25:27.651 --> 25:28.568
[grunting]

25:38.870 --> 25:41.206
[growling]

25:54.886 --> 25:56.930
-[gunshots]
-[cocks gun]

26:00.809 --> 26:02.352
[growling]

26:23.081 --> 26:24.582
[panting]

26:25.250 --> 26:27.252
[suspenseful music]

26:36.177 --> 26:38.013
Hey. Be quiet.

26:38.096 --> 26:39.014
Keep it down, okay?

26:46.563 --> 26:47.897
They're gonna swarm all over it.

26:48.481 --> 26:50.483
Make sure to build a strong foundation.

26:50.567 --> 26:51.484
Well…

26:52.027 --> 26:54.362
There. Right there. Empty spot.

27:03.246 --> 27:04.748
[Cheong-san] Fix it down there first.

27:06.958 --> 27:08.460
[Dae-su] Maybe that's too big.

27:12.589 --> 27:13.590
[Wu-jin] Wait, what?

27:14.674 --> 27:16.259
[object clattering]

27:27.020 --> 27:28.897
[growling]

27:32.692 --> 27:33.860
[Dae-su] It's looking great.

27:36.946 --> 27:38.990
[suspenseful music]

27:43.953 --> 27:45.622
[groaning]

27:45.705 --> 27:46.748
[Joon-seong] Ow. Ow, ow!

27:46.831 --> 27:48.333
Ow, it hurts.

27:48.833 --> 27:52.087
Suck it up.
You're supposed to be a senior.

27:52.712 --> 27:55.215
Why do seniors have to put up
with everything?

27:55.298 --> 27:57.884
I'm not smoking,
and you can't handle that?

27:57.967 --> 28:00.595
-You'll die if you don't smoke?
-Yes, of course.

28:00.678 --> 28:03.473
I feel like I'm going to fucking die,
so you suck it up too, all right?

28:03.556 --> 28:04.432
-We'll take the trail.
-[Joon-seong groans]

28:04.516 --> 28:05.850
The one behind the building.

28:06.393 --> 28:07.977
Once we get past the tennis courts,

28:08.061 --> 28:09.813
we can go through the construction site
and up the mountain.

28:09.896 --> 28:11.272
[sighs]

28:11.356 --> 28:12.649
Do you think we can make it?

28:13.608 --> 28:15.360
-I'm not sure.
-[sighs]

28:15.443 --> 28:16.820
Motherfucker.

28:17.362 --> 28:18.279
Min-jae.

28:19.322 --> 28:21.991
If you don't think he'll make it,
drop him and shoot, okay?

28:22.617 --> 28:23.952
Okay.

28:24.035 --> 28:26.287
Are you talking about me?
[grunts]

28:27.247 --> 28:29.958
-Let's go.
-Up, on three.

28:30.542 --> 28:33.795
Ready? One, two, three!

28:33.878 --> 28:35.630
-[Joon-seong grunting]
-Hold on. Wait.

28:35.713 --> 28:37.298
-[grunting]
-Hold on.

28:38.133 --> 28:39.426
Wait. Wait, wait, wait, wait.

28:41.511 --> 28:44.514
Hey. If you drop this.
You pick them up, okay?

28:46.349 --> 28:47.559
Let's go.

28:48.059 --> 28:50.270
One, two, three.

28:50.353 --> 28:51.855
-[both grunting]
-[Mi-jin] Oh, he's so heavy!

28:51.938 --> 28:53.815
[both panting]

28:53.898 --> 28:54.816
[sighs]
Shit.

28:55.442 --> 28:57.444
[suspenseful music]

29:04.951 --> 29:05.869
[Min-jae] Hold on.

29:10.957 --> 29:12.917
-Ow. Wait. Hold on.
-[Joon-seong groans]

29:15.962 --> 29:17.464
Hey. Look, it broke! What do we do?

29:17.547 --> 29:19.883
-Get back in. Hurry! Get back!
-[Min-jin] Back in?

29:19.966 --> 29:20.884
-[Min-jae] Back! Get back!
-[Min-jin] Back. Damn it!

29:20.967 --> 29:21.968
[zombies growling]

29:23.636 --> 29:25.388
They're coming! Hurry.

29:25.472 --> 29:27.432
[Joon-seong whimpers]

29:29.517 --> 29:30.602
Oh, shit.

29:32.979 --> 29:35.482
Hey. Go without me. Okay?

29:35.565 --> 29:36.399
Idiot.

29:36.983 --> 29:38.860
You can't take me anyway.

29:40.278 --> 29:42.697
You'll post about it on Facebook
if we leave you..

29:42.781 --> 29:43.948
I won't.
[grunts]

29:44.032 --> 29:45.074
I don't trust you.

29:45.658 --> 29:47.160
Stop pretending to care.

29:48.244 --> 29:49.412
You killed Ha-lim.

29:49.913 --> 29:51.414
[Joon-seong breathes heavily]

29:53.750 --> 29:55.502
You don't care about anyone.

29:55.585 --> 29:57.045
You're such a dick.

29:57.670 --> 29:58.671
[sighs]

30:00.340 --> 30:02.675
Let's try once again. Stronger this time.

30:03.384 --> 30:04.385
Okay.

30:08.056 --> 30:09.140
[Joon-seong coughs]

30:15.480 --> 30:17.774
What the hell do you want from me anyway?

30:18.608 --> 30:22.028
It hurts like crazy.
Do you know what dying feels like?

30:23.029 --> 30:24.197
Yeah.

30:24.280 --> 30:26.616
I feel that way every single time
I take a test.

30:28.910 --> 30:29.869
But…

30:30.495 --> 30:32.622
I can only take so much of your pain.

30:33.748 --> 30:35.583
Shut up and be quiet, all right?

30:38.503 --> 30:40.964
CHEONGSAN CHICKEN

30:48.179 --> 30:49.472
You're okay? Doesn't hurt?

30:54.519 --> 30:55.353
Sergeant…

30:57.063 --> 30:58.064
you know…

30:58.815 --> 31:00.817
I'm thinking that
we should probably use our skills

31:00.900 --> 31:02.861
to get ourselves out of here first.

31:02.944 --> 31:05.405
And then they can send
the army in for the kids after, you know?

31:05.488 --> 31:07.073
I think that makes more sense.

31:07.615 --> 31:08.533
Sergeant?

31:11.035 --> 31:12.120
[sighs]
If we all die,

31:12.203 --> 31:14.205
who's going to tell them
about the important laptop--

31:14.289 --> 31:15.832
Ho-seong.

31:15.915 --> 31:16.958
Ho-cheol.

31:17.041 --> 31:18.042
Ho-cheol.

31:19.586 --> 31:22.422
Do you know why some people run
to safety when they are in danger?

31:25.383 --> 31:28.177
Because there are others
who are running into danger for them.

31:28.761 --> 31:31.055
Why put ourselves in danger
if there's no reason to?

31:32.140 --> 31:33.641
You're so frustrating.

31:34.517 --> 31:35.768
I ought to just…

31:36.477 --> 31:39.314
If you die,
I'll put in a request with the higher-ups

31:39.397 --> 31:41.983
for a statue of you as big as the one
of Admiral Yi Sun-sin.

31:42.066 --> 31:43.318
Okay? Happy?

31:44.777 --> 31:45.987
[Jae-ik] What's with this guy?

31:46.654 --> 31:49.699
If you're feeling scared,
you could just stay here.

31:50.283 --> 31:52.869
Goodness. Very well put. Yes.

31:53.369 --> 31:57.749
Okay, listen.
We're gonna leave together now.

31:58.291 --> 32:00.627
We're gonna go zoom on the motorcycle, hm?

32:01.711 --> 32:02.795
What about Mommy?

32:10.219 --> 32:11.304
Well, your mommy…

32:12.889 --> 32:15.099
Let's just come back for her later, okay?

32:19.771 --> 32:22.649
My son is about your age.
He's very handsome.

32:22.732 --> 32:24.484
I can introduce you to him if you like.

32:25.234 --> 32:27.445
I already have a boyfriend though.

32:30.448 --> 32:33.326
Uh… Hey, what did I say to do
once we go out?

32:33.910 --> 32:37.413
You said to keep my eyes shut tightly
and hold onto you.

32:37.497 --> 32:40.249
That's right. Good girl. Very good.

32:41.292 --> 32:42.335
Are you ready?

32:43.294 --> 32:44.170
Uh, no.

32:44.671 --> 32:46.255
[screaming, grunting]

32:46.965 --> 32:48.675
CHEONGSAN CHICKEN

32:50.635 --> 32:52.971
Go faster! Faster!

32:53.054 --> 32:55.098
-Speed up! Speed up!
-Shut up!

32:55.181 --> 32:56.683
You're drawing them to us,
you fucking idiot!

32:56.766 --> 32:59.310
-[screaming]
-[Jae-ik] Shut up, I say!

32:59.394 --> 33:00.311
[growling]

33:00.395 --> 33:01.854
-[screaming]
-Quiet, asshole!

33:01.938 --> 33:03.106
[both screaming]

33:03.189 --> 33:04.232
Watch it. Oh, my god!

33:04.315 --> 33:06.067
[screaming]

33:08.736 --> 33:11.239
-[Jae-ik] They're coming!
-[Ho-cheol] Oh, they're right behind us!

33:11.322 --> 33:12.240
[Jae-ik] Look ahead, dipshit!

33:12.323 --> 33:13.992
[Ho-cheol screaming]

33:14.075 --> 33:16.244
[zombies growling]

33:16.327 --> 33:17.662
[Ho-cheol] Turn! Turn, turn!

33:17.745 --> 33:19.414
Go!
[screaming]

33:19.497 --> 33:21.374
-Turn! Turn!
-Where? Where?

33:21.958 --> 33:24.127
[both screaming]

33:25.211 --> 33:26.254
[tires screech]

33:26.337 --> 33:28.297
Just go this way, sir. This way. Go.

33:28.381 --> 33:29.465
[engine revving]

33:30.258 --> 33:32.093
-[Ho-cheol] Watch out! Watch out! Careful!
-[Jae-ik groans]

33:32.176 --> 33:33.302
[Ho-cheol] Right! Go right!

33:34.804 --> 33:37.140
Oh, a dead-end!
[grumbles]

33:37.223 --> 33:39.267
-What do we do?
-Wait.

33:39.767 --> 33:40.727
Wait, no! There's a way!

33:40.810 --> 33:42.895
-[Ho-cheol] Oh, my god. There is?
-[Jae-ik] There is!

33:42.979 --> 33:43.980
Let's go.

33:44.063 --> 33:45.606
-[honking]
-Hey, what are you--

33:45.690 --> 33:47.775
-[honking continues]
-Stop doing that.

33:48.276 --> 33:51.279
-Right here you fuckers!
-[both screaming]

33:51.362 --> 33:52.572
-[growling]
-[Ho-cheol] Go!

33:52.655 --> 33:53.656
[Ho-cheol wailing]

33:55.033 --> 33:56.409
[zombies growling]

33:56.909 --> 33:59.162
Yeah!
[Ho-cheol laughing]

34:00.204 --> 34:01.664
[both laughing]

34:02.665 --> 34:03.666
[Ho-cheol] Se-bin, we're saved!

34:03.750 --> 34:05.793
[Jae-ik] Pipe down
unless you want more of them.

34:06.377 --> 34:07.336
[Orangibberish] Help me!

34:07.420 --> 34:08.796
Huh? What?

34:08.880 --> 34:10.173
-[Orangibberish] Here, over here!
-[Ho-cheol] What's that sound?

34:10.256 --> 34:12.050
-[Orangibberish] Please help.
-Hear that?

34:12.133 --> 34:13.092
[Orangibberish] Here!

34:13.176 --> 34:14.510
Look up! Over here!

34:15.178 --> 34:16.054
Over here.

34:16.637 --> 34:17.930
-[Orangibberish] Help me!
-What is that?

34:18.014 --> 34:19.432
[Orangibberish] Hey, you idiot!

34:20.058 --> 34:21.476
Idiot, asshole.

34:23.853 --> 34:25.354
-What the?
-[Orangibberish] What took you so long?

34:25.438 --> 34:27.940
-[Jae-ik] All right, hang on.
-Sergeant, let's just go. Come on.

34:28.024 --> 34:30.651
-Huh?
-Let's just go. Come on, please.

34:30.735 --> 34:31.944
[Orangibberish] Please help me.

34:32.028 --> 34:33.321
Just go. Let's go.

34:33.404 --> 34:34.947
[Orangibberish] Do you have
something to drink?

34:35.031 --> 34:36.115
Ooh. There's more, look.

34:36.199 --> 34:37.492
What? Where?

34:39.786 --> 34:41.162
Ah, there's nothing.

34:43.039 --> 34:44.290
Can you climb down?

34:44.373 --> 34:46.084
No. I hurt my leg.

34:46.167 --> 34:48.252
-[Orangibberish] I can't get down.
-Let's just go.

34:48.336 --> 34:50.254
Come on, please. Let's go.

34:51.756 --> 34:53.216
Wait, wait, wait. What are you doing?

34:53.758 --> 34:55.259
-What are you gonna do?
-[Jae-ik] There.

34:56.219 --> 34:59.180
-Here, take the baby.
-Huh?

34:59.847 --> 35:01.307
[Orangbberish] Hurry, sir. Please.

35:01.849 --> 35:03.643
-Hold on.
-What are you gonna do?

35:03.726 --> 35:04.602
[Jae-ik] Stay still.

35:05.645 --> 35:06.938
Stay right here.

35:07.021 --> 35:09.357
Bring the bike close. Shit.

35:09.440 --> 35:11.025
[Orangibberish] Yeah, climb up that way.

35:11.609 --> 35:13.361
Bring it close. Asshole.

35:13.444 --> 35:15.363
[Orangibberish] Come here. Hurry. Hurry.

35:15.446 --> 35:16.739
Fuck this.

35:16.823 --> 35:17.824
[engine revving]

35:17.907 --> 35:19.450
[Jae-ik] Ho-cheol! Ho-cheol!

35:19.534 --> 35:20.409
-[Orangibberish] Where is he going?
-Stop it!

35:20.493 --> 35:21.661
[Jae-ik] Ho-cheol! Wait!

35:21.744 --> 35:23.037
[Orangibberish] Where the hell
is he going?

35:23.121 --> 35:26.374
-College boy! Stop!
-[Orangibberish] Get back here, you moron.

35:26.457 --> 35:28.459
[zombie growling]

35:46.519 --> 35:48.729
[sighs]
All right. I think this is good enough.

35:50.439 --> 35:51.399
Okay.

35:51.482 --> 35:54.068
[grunts]
Aren't you guys coming?

35:54.652 --> 35:56.320
We left a gap over there for you.

35:57.488 --> 35:58.656
Let's go.

36:11.752 --> 36:13.004
Why aren't you coming over?

36:13.588 --> 36:15.423
Well, someone has to stay
to open the door.

36:16.465 --> 36:17.592
[sighs]

36:18.467 --> 36:20.386
Couldn't you have come up
with a better plan?

36:21.387 --> 36:22.305
[Cheong-san] It's okay.

36:22.805 --> 36:24.807
-I'll come over right away.
-[Su-hyeok] Wait.

36:24.891 --> 36:26.142
I'll come.

36:26.225 --> 36:27.643
-It's fine.
-[Su-hyeok grunts]

36:27.727 --> 36:29.312
It is not fine.
[Su-hyeok grunts]

36:30.229 --> 36:31.063
Here.

36:33.691 --> 36:35.026
[growling]

36:44.452 --> 36:45.995
What happened with you and Gwi-nam?

36:46.954 --> 36:48.372
He said he was gonna kill you.

36:52.710 --> 36:53.836
Shit.

36:55.421 --> 36:57.506
It's because I saw him
killing the principal.

36:58.633 --> 37:02.178
I said I was going to tell the cops,
so he tried to kill me.

37:04.597 --> 37:05.514
Prick.

37:10.311 --> 37:11.187
[sighs]

37:14.857 --> 37:16.108
Gwi-nam's dead.

37:17.109 --> 37:17.944
Yeah?

37:18.027 --> 37:19.153
Mm-hm.

37:19.737 --> 37:22.114
He fell from up high
when I was fighting him.

37:24.992 --> 37:27.203
-And I'm in love with Nam-ra.
-Huh?

37:28.454 --> 37:30.248
I've liked Nam-ra for a while now.

37:30.331 --> 37:31.249
You have?

37:31.832 --> 37:33.751
You be good to On-jo, okay?

37:34.710 --> 37:37.546
Don't treat her like she's a guy, moron.

37:39.090 --> 37:41.926
You ready? I'll do it.

37:43.594 --> 37:45.554
Go. Get over there.

37:46.681 --> 37:47.640
Go.

37:59.277 --> 38:01.279
[suspenseful music]

38:02.530 --> 38:03.698
[growling]

38:07.076 --> 38:08.369
[grunting]

38:10.413 --> 38:13.124
-[beep]
-[classical music playing]

38:17.086 --> 38:18.796
[zombies growling]

38:23.384 --> 38:24.802
[Dae-su mutters]

38:37.398 --> 38:39.483
[zombies growling]

38:40.067 --> 38:41.694
[all grunting]

38:47.325 --> 38:48.784
[Hyo-ryeong grunting]

38:57.960 --> 38:59.211
Oh, shit.

39:00.004 --> 39:01.881
Dae-su, you got to make some noise!

39:03.132 --> 39:04.425
Die, zombies!

39:04.508 --> 39:10.848
Fucking die!

39:13.225 --> 39:14.393
Do it one more time.

39:14.477 --> 39:15.603
Shit.

39:16.812 --> 39:18.606
Stupid zombies.

39:18.689 --> 39:25.446
-Motherfuckers!
-[zombies growling]

39:40.836 --> 39:41.670
Wu-jin!

39:41.754 --> 39:44.715
We can't go yet! Not yet.

39:47.885 --> 39:51.389
-[zombies snarling]
-[instruments playing loudly]

40:06.487 --> 40:08.781
-[zombies growling]
-[instruments playing loudly]

40:14.078 --> 40:16.080
[ominous music]

40:32.555 --> 40:33.806
[grunts]

40:41.981 --> 40:43.315
-Nam-ra!
-[grunts]

40:45.860 --> 40:47.319
[grunting]

40:58.414 --> 41:00.374
It's not going to hold up!

41:03.836 --> 41:04.795
Shit.

41:07.298 --> 41:09.550
How much longer is it gonna take?
Let's go!

41:11.635 --> 41:14.805
A little more. Not yet!

41:14.889 --> 41:16.015
[all grunting]

41:20.644 --> 41:21.937
[grunts]

41:27.485 --> 41:28.736
[whimpers]

41:32.698 --> 41:34.074
[growling]

41:43.292 --> 41:46.170
[medic] We need to study him
to create a treatment or a vaccine,

41:46.253 --> 41:48.589
but we don't have equipment or scientists.

41:49.507 --> 41:51.175
We'll have to take him to the KDCA.

41:52.092 --> 41:53.010
[machine beeps]

41:54.053 --> 41:55.471
He cannot leave the quarantine zone

41:55.554 --> 41:57.181
under any circumstances,
do you understand?

41:58.307 --> 42:00.226
Find scientists and build the facility.

42:00.809 --> 42:03.354
We will airlift all necessary equipment.

42:04.939 --> 42:08.609
-What's his name?
-[medic 2] Staff Sergeant Lee Jae-jun.

42:08.692 --> 42:12.363
A week away from discharge,
but he volunteered for the operation.

42:13.197 --> 42:15.950
Get his parents consent to do research.

42:17.409 --> 42:20.496
We're under martial law,
we don't need his parent's consent.

42:21.497 --> 42:22.957
If you decide to give consent,

42:23.666 --> 42:26.502
we can begin the experiment
or autopsy right away.

42:27.044 --> 42:28.587
I said call his parents.

42:30.256 --> 42:31.715
Even under martial law,

42:32.299 --> 42:34.301
that's our duty
for taking away their child.

42:35.219 --> 42:36.262
Yes, sir.

42:48.107 --> 42:49.441
[panting]

42:50.067 --> 42:51.610
Commander, sir.

42:52.236 --> 42:54.321
There's assemblywoman awaiting testing.

42:54.405 --> 42:56.282
[Seon-moo] She has to follow rules.

42:56.365 --> 42:59.034
It's Park Eun-hee
from the National Defense Committee.

42:59.577 --> 43:00.953
[Seon-moo sighs]
Damn it.

43:10.129 --> 43:11.589
[Seon-moo] I'm the commander here.

43:13.465 --> 43:15.217
Nice to meet you. I'm--

43:15.301 --> 43:17.469
[Seon-moo] Even if you are
an assemblywoman,

43:17.553 --> 43:20.014
around here you're not going
to get any special treatment.

43:20.848 --> 43:22.600
That's all I came to tell you.

43:23.267 --> 43:25.352
Don't bother these people
trying to do their jobs.

43:26.353 --> 43:29.231
I'd appreciate it
if you'd stay quiet and follow the rules.

43:29.315 --> 43:32.610
That's fine. I have a favor to ask though.

43:33.110 --> 43:35.112
Please send a chopper
to Hyosan High School.

43:35.696 --> 43:38.032
There's a firefighter on his way there.
He's by himself.

43:38.782 --> 43:40.826
Commander. Hey. Wait!

43:41.785 --> 43:44.163
You got to send the helicopter
to the high school.

43:44.246 --> 43:45.956
We have to save the children!

43:48.125 --> 43:50.127
Even wars can't rid of schools.

43:50.210 --> 43:53.505
Even if you win,
if the schools are gone, we've lost.

43:56.008 --> 43:58.010
[suspenseful music]

44:06.685 --> 44:08.729
[Seon-moo] How many students
have we saved so far?

44:09.688 --> 44:12.066
So far, zero sir.

44:12.900 --> 44:14.234
We don't think anyone got out

44:14.318 --> 44:16.612
because all the students
were in class at that time.

44:18.572 --> 44:19.657
Are choppers available?

44:19.740 --> 44:22.159
No, sir. They've all been sent
on missions.

44:26.830 --> 44:30.417
Request a Black Hawk immediately.
Have them scan high schools in Hyosan.

44:31.960 --> 44:33.003
Absolutely, sir.

44:33.545 --> 44:36.131
MAP OF HYOSAN

44:41.178 --> 44:42.012
[sighs]

44:47.559 --> 44:49.812
Gangha-dong as well?

44:53.440 --> 44:55.275
Isn't that where your mother's house is?

44:59.446 --> 45:02.408
Once he's named in the rescue zone,
we can check there.

45:05.327 --> 45:06.286
Okay, sir.

45:12.626 --> 45:13.877
-[sighs]
-[door closes]

45:15.671 --> 45:17.840
-[sighs]
-[paper rustles]

45:22.803 --> 45:25.180
Clear. We have to go now!

45:31.478 --> 45:32.354
[Wu-jin] Hurry!

45:36.316 --> 45:37.234
Hey, let's go!

45:38.068 --> 45:40.404
-Go!
-You go first.

45:49.413 --> 45:51.457
I'm gonna shit my pants. Go!

45:52.416 --> 45:53.292
[grunting]

45:54.960 --> 45:56.545
[zombies growling]

45:57.463 --> 45:59.006
-Come on.
-[Wu-jin] Let's go.

45:59.756 --> 46:02.009
[foreboding music]

46:06.221 --> 46:07.890
[grunting]

46:09.892 --> 46:11.310
[zombies growling]

46:18.525 --> 46:19.985
[all panting]

46:22.404 --> 46:23.322
Hurry.

46:25.407 --> 46:26.366
[growling]

46:30.120 --> 46:31.205
[Gwi-nam] Move!

46:46.470 --> 46:50.140
PROPER EDUCATION BREEDS GOOD CHARACTER!

46:50.849 --> 46:52.351
[helicopter whirring]

46:53.602 --> 46:55.562
[pilot] Cheongmok Middle School.

46:55.646 --> 46:57.356
Impossible to check for survivors.

46:58.232 --> 46:59.608
Alpha lifted.

46:59.691 --> 47:01.109
I'll go to Hyosan High.

47:03.529 --> 47:05.072
[helicopter whirring]

47:05.155 --> 47:06.615
[all panting]

47:12.162 --> 47:13.664
[grunts]

47:14.248 --> 47:15.332
Come on.

47:17.626 --> 47:19.419
[growling]

47:33.850 --> 47:37.020
[growling continues]

47:58.208 --> 47:59.751
[helicopter whirring in distance]

48:04.840 --> 48:06.675
Over here! Over here!

48:06.758 --> 48:08.176
Here! I'm here!

48:08.260 --> 48:10.304
-Over here!
-[door clattering]

48:11.680 --> 48:13.223
[door clattering]

48:18.562 --> 48:19.771
Come on, open it.

48:21.481 --> 48:22.357
It's locked.

48:22.441 --> 48:23.817
-[sighs]
-[Dae-su] What?

48:24.568 --> 48:25.944
Move.

48:26.028 --> 48:28.572
[pounding on door]

48:28.655 --> 48:31.033
-[helicopter whirring]
-[pounding continues]

48:33.035 --> 48:34.661
Wait. Get back. Move.

48:34.745 --> 48:36.913
[keypad clacks]

48:36.997 --> 48:38.999
[alarm beeping]

48:39.082 --> 48:40.250
Shit.

48:40.334 --> 48:42.085
[alarm beeping]

48:43.295 --> 48:44.338
Is anyone there?

48:45.047 --> 48:46.173
Anyone?

48:46.757 --> 48:49.176
-[Joon-yeong] Is anyone there? Anyone?
-[banging on door]

48:49.885 --> 48:50.761
Open the door!

48:51.511 --> 48:53.639
[Dae-su] Of course not! Get back.

48:54.848 --> 48:57.184
One, two, three!

48:57.267 --> 48:58.310
One, two, three!

48:58.852 --> 49:00.354
[grunting]

49:03.732 --> 49:05.859
THE ROOFTOP IS OFF LIMITS TO STUDENTS

49:06.693 --> 49:07.819
Fuck.

49:07.903 --> 49:09.696
-[breathes heavily]
-[banging on door]

49:09.780 --> 49:11.365
[Joon-yeong screaming]

49:13.075 --> 49:13.992
Hear that?

49:14.076 --> 49:15.327
What?

49:15.410 --> 49:17.496
-[grunting]
-[banging on door]

49:21.583 --> 49:22.918
[Eun-ji] We're outcasts again.

49:23.627 --> 49:24.753
And this is still hell.

49:24.836 --> 49:26.672
I really hope everyone dies.

49:26.755 --> 49:27.964
All of them.

49:28.048 --> 49:30.092
-[banging on door]
-[helicopter whirring]

49:40.435 --> 49:41.561
[Cheong-san] Mom.

49:42.396 --> 49:43.355
It's me.

49:44.648 --> 49:46.149
Dad, you're okay too, right?

49:46.817 --> 49:47.984
I'm…

49:50.237 --> 49:51.530
I'm doing good.

49:51.613 --> 49:52.698
[growling]

49:54.157 --> 49:55.117
Mom.

49:56.576 --> 49:58.704
Cheongsan Chicken
still sounds stupid, by the way.

50:00.205 --> 50:02.791
If it were Cheongsan Auto, Cheongsan Group
or Cheongsan Air

50:02.874 --> 50:04.126
that be different,

50:05.877 --> 50:06.878
that'll be okay.

50:08.839 --> 50:10.966
CHEONGSAN CHICKEN

50:11.049 --> 50:16.263
HYOSAN HIGH SCHOOL

50:16.847 --> 50:18.598
-[helicopter whirring]
-[gasps]

50:20.100 --> 50:21.893
[growling in distance]

50:23.562 --> 50:24.479
They're here.

50:24.563 --> 50:26.565
[foreboding music]

50:33.905 --> 50:36.283
[growling]

50:39.494 --> 50:41.079
[grunting]

50:48.211 --> 50:50.630
DOOR WILL OPEN AUTOMATICALLY
IN CASE OF FIRE

50:58.096 --> 50:58.972
[Cheong-san] Get back!

51:05.479 --> 51:07.439
[helicopter whirring]

51:15.572 --> 51:16.740
[Nam-ra] Throw this over!

51:21.870 --> 51:23.538
[growling]

51:27.083 --> 51:29.586
[growling continues]

51:47.270 --> 51:48.814
Out of my way.

51:48.897 --> 51:51.149
[zombie gagging]

52:01.952 --> 52:03.954
[soldier 3] Freeze! Freeze!

52:04.996 --> 52:06.957
[soldier 4] Get down. Get down!

52:10.836 --> 52:12.003
35.6 DEGREES CELSIUS

52:12.838 --> 52:13.880
[soldier 3] Are you okay?

52:17.717 --> 52:19.135
[soldier 3] Where are the others?

52:20.303 --> 52:21.513
Isn't there anyone else?

52:26.893 --> 52:29.396
-[Joon-yeong] Hold onto it!
-[Hyo-ryeong] Come on. Hold it tight!

52:29.479 --> 52:31.439
[zombies growling]

52:33.775 --> 52:34.901
[grunts]

52:46.872 --> 52:48.790
ONE HEART

52:48.874 --> 52:50.500
[screeching]

53:00.093 --> 53:01.511
[snarls]

53:07.893 --> 53:09.895
[tense music]

53:34.085 --> 53:36.087
[closing theme music]

57:19.686 --> 57:22.021
ALL CHARACTERS, LOCATIONS, ORGANIZATIONS,

57:22.105 --> 57:24.315
AND EVENTS IN THIS SHOW ARE FICTIONAL.
